\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {XVI}{\ignorespaces Reads are not the only cost. Two further charging models applied to the same baseline retrievals; the reads-only model is the Reads column itself. A multiplexed run charges 50 read-equivalents per batch of 50 reads and 500 per container library preparation; and a separate sequencing run per batch (2{,}000 per batch). Costs in read-equivalents (thousands). Switching containers every batch is free in the first model and dominant in the third.}}{20}{}\protected@file@percent }
